3	/**
4	 * GameShowcaseCarousel — a premium, horizontally-scrolling showcase of the
5	 * supported game titles for the marketing /game-servers hero. Each title is a
6	 * "cover" card built from the owner's real <GameLogo> mark on its per-game brand
7	 * gradient, with a soft brand-colour glow. The active card expands to reveal an
8	 * interactive player-slot selector whose pills + "Starting at $X/mo" are driven
9	 * ENTIRELY by the DB game-plan tiers passed in (no invented player counts or
10	 * prices). Reduced-motion users get the resting frame — every transition is
11	 * motion-safe.
12	 *
13	 * Interaction:
14	 *   • Click any cover (or use the ◀ ▶ arrows) to make it the active title.
15	 *   • The active title shows "Players" pills, one per DB tier that defines
16	 *     `slots`; picking a pill swaps the shown price + RAM to that exact tier.
17	 *   • Mobile: the track is a CSS scroll-snap carousel (swipe horizontally).
18	 */
